   "line": [
    "Qb6"
   ],
   "spoken": "The queen swings to b6, pressing on b2 and f2. If White grabs on c5, recapturing with the bishop hits f2 and the e5-pawn and breaks up White's pawn chain — so the pawn-grab only helps Black.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "A queen on b6 in these structures forks the weak b2/f2 pawns and dares the chain-breaking capture.",
   "plans": "Provoke concessions on the queenside and against the chain."
  },
